# MagicMirror – architecture (Mermaid, entspricht der SVG)

Gleicher Inhalt wie `magicmirror-architecture.svg`: zehn Module, Radar über GPIO, OpenWeather bei den externen Diensten. GitHub rendert den Block direkt.

```mermaid
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif", "fontSize": "14px", "lineColor": "#7A7A74", "clusterBkg": "#FBFBF9", "clusterBorder": "#A9A9A2", "edgeLabelBackground": "#FBFBF9"}}}%%
flowchart TB
  subgraph DEV["Development"]
    direction LR
    MAC["<b>Mac</b><br/>VS Code Remote-SSH"] ~~~ GH["<b>GitHub</b><br/>raspberrypi-magicmirror"]
  end

  subgraph PI["Raspberry Pi 4B (8 GB) · Raspberry Pi OS Trixie, arm64"]
    direction TB
    UNIT["<b>magicmirror-user.service</b><br/>systemd user service"] --> WL["<b>labwc (Wayland) + kanshi</b><br/>compositor, portrait rotation"]
    WL --> MM["<b>MagicMirror² (Electron)</b><br/>UI and module host"]
    MM --> MODS

    subgraph MODS["Modules"]
      direction LR
      subgraph INFO["Information"]
        direction TB
        CAL["MMM-MyGCalendar"]
        OWM["MMM-OpenWeatherMapForecast"]
        RAIN["MMM-RAIN-MAP"]
        MVG["MMM-MVG"]
        GLOBE["MMM-Globe"]
      end
      subgraph MUSIC["Music"]
        direction TB
        SPOT["MMM-OnSpotify"]
        LYR["MMM-LiveLyrics"]
      end
      subgraph CTRL["Pages"]
        direction TB
        PAGES["MMM-pages"]
      end
      subgraph OWN["Custom modules"]
        direction TB
        SP["<b>MMM-SpotifyPages</b><br/>page switching by playback"]
        GW["<b>MMM-GuestWifi</b><br/>guest Wi-Fi QR code"]
      end
    end
  end

  subgraph HW["Hardware"]
    direction LR
    WP["<b>Witty Pi 4 Mini</b><br/>on 07:30, off 22:15"]
    RAD["<b>mmWave radar</b><br/>presence via GPIO"]
    MON["<b>MSI 27″ monitor</b><br/>2560×1440, portrait"]
    GLASS["<b>Two-way mirror</b><br/>laminated safety glass"]
  end

  subgraph EXT["External services"]
    direction LR
    SAPI[("Spotify Web API")]
    OAPI[("OpenWeather")]
    LAPI[("Lyrics API")]
  end

  DEV -- "SSH" --> PI
  MODS ~~~ HW
  WP ~~~ MON
  RAD ~~~ GLASS
  PI -- "GPIO · HDMI + CEC · power" --- HW
  MODS -- "HTTPS" --> EXT

  classDef dev  fill:#EEF0F3,stroke:#8A94A6,color:#2F3A4A
  classDef sw   fill:#E7EDF5,stroke:#8198B8,color:#2C3E5C
